# ==================================
# ASOOSE Vendor App - Environment Variables
# ==================================

# API Configuration
# -----------------
# Choose the appropriate URL based on your development setup:

# 1. For Android Emulator (10.0.2.2 is the special IP for the host machine)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3000/v1/api

# 2. For iOS Simulator (localhost works for iOS simulator)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/v1/api

# 3. For Physical Device (replace with your computer's IP address)
# Find your IP:
#   - Windows: Open CMD and run: ipconfig (look for IPv4 Address)
#   - Mac: Open Terminal and run: ifconfig | grep "inet " | grep -v 127.0.0.1
#   - Linux: ip addr show
# Example:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.100:3000/v1/api

# 4. For Production
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.asoose.com/v1/api

# Notes:
# - Make sure your backend is running on port 3000
# - For physical devices, ensure your computer and device are on the same WiFi network
# - For production builds, update this to your production API URL
